	<widget name="main_menu/difficulty_select/skulls/unlock_text" type="text" controller="1" left="68" top="90" width="504" height="190" text="How should the skulls be unlocked?\n\nALL UNLOCKED: every skull can be turned on\nright away.\n\nUNLOCK BY PLAYING: Birthday Party is yours.\nEnemies carry the others: pick one up to\nuse it on that level, and finish the level\nto keep it. Die before then and it's lost." font="ui\small_ui" color="#FFFFFFFF">
